{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34107","headline":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平入声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平入声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生何违时，一室习寂历。\n松声将飘堂，岳色欲压席。\n弹琴奔玄云，斸药折白石。\n如教题君诗，若得札玉册。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}